        "The packet is about beetle mating behavior and inbreeding depression, not the psychology/counselling field of learning; that field assignment is not supported by the source.",
        "The definition’s broad generalization about inbreeding avoidance as a general reproductive process is only partially supported by this single study, which discusses pre- and post-copulatory inbreeding avoidance in Tribolium castaneum and also reports unexpected kin mating rather than a general consensus definition."
